      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T08:09:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t seem to work if user calls `Queue.Submit` before writing to the CPU memory.\n\n```\ndesc.mapAtCreation \u003d true;\n\n// This will create the cpu shadow copy and enqueue the code block here.\nwgpu::Buffer buffer \u003d device.CreateBuffer(\u0026desc);\n\n// Get the CPU shadow copy\u0027s pointer\nuint* mappedPointer \u003d (uint*)buffer.GetMappedRange();\n\n// This will flush the enqueued GL commands and copy the unitialized shadow\n// copy\u0027s data to the GL buffer.\nqueue.Submit();\n\n// This writes to a dangling pointer no longer valid because the shadow copy has\n// been clearedd.\n*mappedPointer \u003d 2;\n\n// buffer still doesn\u0027t contain the value 2 written above.\nbuffer.Unmap();\n```\n\n// User",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 212,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 212,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "a9f5b656016c26330e1b0d38581a3f2abd6a3935",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c335c471_87273998",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/opengl/BufferGL.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 212,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000024
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T17:37:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch, thanks.\n\nI\u0027ve moved the glMapBufferRange() call to UnmapImpl(), leaving MapAtCreationImpl() making no GL calls in the deferred case. That should keep the mMappedData ptr valid (and pointing at the staging buffer) until it is uploaded and set to null in Unmap(). I\u0027ve also added a BufferTest based on your test case.\n\nDoes that fix the problem, or are there other cases I should consider?",
      "parentUuid": "9c9c9cde_62f58d39",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 212,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 212,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "a9f5b656016c26330e1b0d38581a3f2abd6a3935",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
